# Scheduled jobs

The scheduler enqueues a job every five minutes. A worker from the worker pool picks the job up and writes its output to the result store.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Scheduler] --> B[Worker pool] --> C[Result store]
  C --> D[Alerting]
```

When a job fails, alerting pages the on-call engineer after the result store records the failure twice in a row.
